        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Further source groups the component has a bone for, honoured only on a vertex that also
carries one of \ref remap&apos;s groups -- the reverse remap turned around. A hair vertex
weighted head + bang keeps its head weight on the Bang&apos;s head bone; a face vertex weighted
to the head alone still collapses. Only used by a negative-index component
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
